# Applies to builds whose context is the repo root — i.e. the bff-* services
# (see docker-compose.yml). They only need bff-core/ and their own
# domains/<name>/bff/ tree; everything else is excluded to keep the context lean.
# (The web builds use their own ./domains/<name>/web context and are unaffected.)
.git
.idea
**/.gradle
**/build
**/node_modules
**/dist
domains/*/web
keycloak
proxy
*.md
*.drawio
